WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.410
- Do you believe in
like supernatural stuff?

00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:02.370
Have you ever seen ghosts or stuff?

00:00:02.370 --> 00:00:03.720
I haven't and I want to.

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:06.168
- Oh, come over to my house.

00:00:06.168 --> 00:00:07.565
Yes, I have.

00:00:07.565 --> 00:00:09.510
- I dunno if they show themselves to me.

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:11.160
- Thank God they haven't
actually shown themselves,

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:12.750
'cause I don't know if I
wouldn't be here right now.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:15.060
- I would want to see it.

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:15.893
- You think that.

00:00:15.893 --> 00:00:16.726
You think that.

00:00:16.726 --> 00:00:18.450
- No, I 100% think it would be cool.

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:20.490
- Okay, well I have, yeah,
I've had some things happen.

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:23.190
I've lost both my parents and
I've had some things happen.

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:24.780
Like a lot of things happen, especially

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:26.193
after my mom passed away,

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:31.050
or very strange things
happen, like lights going on

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:33.600
where they weren't even plugged
in, really weird things.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:34.433
- Yeah.

00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:36.420
- So, I have no doubt I believe in that.

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:39.240
And then my house that I live
in now was built in like 1882

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:41.910
and moved by like trolley in 1912.

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:44.220
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- And I hear footsteps a lot.

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:45.930
Every one in my family
has heard the footsteps.

00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:46.763
- Yeah.

00:00:46.763 --> 00:00:50.490
- And Smokey Robinson
actually used to own my home

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:53.490
and I was at an Oscar
party this past Oscars

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:55.620
and he said, "Oh, have you
heard the footsteps yet?"

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:57.137
I did not need to hear that.

00:00:57.137 --> 00:00:57.990
(audience laughing)

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:00.870
I was like, I wanted to believe
that I was imagining it.

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:03.390
But the funny thing is
it feels safe though.

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:04.620
It's like a good spirit.

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:06.024
- Yeah, I don't feel unsafe around it.

00:01:06.024 --> 00:01:06.960
Yeah.

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:07.830
- But we've seen the movies,

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:08.663
we don't know what's gonna happen.

00:01:08.663 --> 00:01:09.690
- Those are movies though.

00:01:09.690 --> 00:01:11.883
I really wanna see one, Kyle, okay.

